			son of Hermes and Aphrodite, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				23.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				124
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				4.619
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as
			Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. πάθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Leonid.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.69
			</span></i>.</div>
